Package: MIRA
Type: Package
Title: Multilevel Inference and Regression Analysis
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R:
    person(
        given = "Davide",
        family = "Celani",
        email = "davide.celani.00@gmail.com",
        role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description:
    Bayesian multilevel modeling of continuous longitudinal outcomes using
    Stan, with Student-t, Gaussian, and log-normal observation models.
    Supports multiple treatment arms, subject-level covariates, configurable
    priors, posterior contrasts, and probabilities of meaningful change.
    Also provides longitudinal data exploration, frequentist analyses,
    and reproducible report generation.
